{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"he shakes his head \"the name fits for sure. wasn't always called bones. took a while for that to stick\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T04:07:44.396000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877403368413343754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"As long as you aint dead\" he shrugs","created_at":"2021-08-18T04:09:20.550000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877403771712454667","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"sure I'm not? well, the old me certainly is. he'd never be up to anything like this.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T04:10:16.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877404007100981320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Well if you were dead... I wouldnt be speaking to you normally now would I?\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T04:12:15.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877404504566411274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"hard to tell, I've been through two names, three bodies and died in between each of him. any memory of my first life doesn't feel like the ones I make now. 'bones' isn't 'andross mortem' these days\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T04:14:57.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877405182961524758","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
